                              },
                              {
                                "label": "DPF performance"
                              },
                              {
                                "label": "DEF efficiency"
                              },
                              {
                                "label": "Oil health"
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-fms-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "<a href=\"/service\">By addressing common maintenance issues</a>—such as coolant levels, diesel particulate filter (DPF) performance, diesel exhaust fluid (DEF) efficiency, and oil health—OnCommand Connection helps fleet managers stay ahead of potential problems. Additionally, managers can receive weekly reports via email or access real-time data through an online portal, ensuring full visibility into fleet performance.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-equipment",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A Trustworthy Fleet Starts With the Right Equipment",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "equipment"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-equipment-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State International, we understand that maintaining a reliable fleet starts with investing in high-quality vehicles. Whether you’re looking to expand your fleet or upgrade your current trucks, we offer a wide selection of top-tier commercial vehicles designed for durability and efficiency. Visit our locations in <a href=\"/locations/tampa\">Tampa</a>, <a href=\"/locations/sarasota\">Sarasota</a>, or <a href=\"/locations/davenport\">Davenport</a> to explore our truck inventory and fleet management solutions. Let’s work together to keep your business moving forward.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "links-equipment-2-row",
